{
  "bookId": "hero-211205",
  "id": "bond-43802",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "43802001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "不知为何，最近家中的电器总是在出故障。在电视机之后是电冰箱，继而是电磁炉。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43802002",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "终于在某天深夜，房间停电了。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43802004",
              "text": "已经不早了，明天再修好了。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43802004",
              "text": "事已至此，先睡觉吧。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43802003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43802004",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43802005",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "在被窝里准备入睡的时候，听到了窸窸窣窣的声音，似乎有什么钻了进来。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43802007",
              "text": "是谁？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43802006",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43802007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "是我，对不起……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43802009",
              "text": "为什么要道歉？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43802008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43802009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "今晚我看到你房间还亮着，就想给你煮夜宵，但刚打开电磁炉，家里就暗下来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43802010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "按照明灯的开关也没有反应。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43802011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "可能是电磁炉短路引起了跳闸……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43802012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "对不起，我似乎总会把家里的电器弄坏，之前的电冰箱也是……给你添麻烦了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43802014",
              "text": "没关系，旧的不去，新的不来。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43802013",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43802014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "谢谢，在这个世界能遇到你真是太好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43802015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "哈啊……我也有点困了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43802016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "汐音",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "43802018",
              "text": "汐音？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "43802018",
              "text": "睡着了吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "43802017",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43802018",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "昏暗的房间仅能看见淡淡的月光，少女依偎在你怀里，发出规律的呼吸声。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "43802019",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "今晚，想必会是一个好梦。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
